":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Drive the Durmitor ring","type":"activity","detail":"A circuit of about 73 km climbs over the Sedlo pass at 1900 m, with pull ins for the layered wall of Prutas and open pasture.","season":[6,7,8,9,10],"link":"https://www.slowroads.eu/en/route/durmitor-ring","evidence":{"n_sources":7,"of":26,"urls":["https://lifeontheroam.com/durmitor-ring-montenegro/","https://www.slowroads.eu/en/route/durmitor-ring","https://anastasifink.com/durmitor-zabljak-montenegro-one-day-route-viewpoints/","https://360monte.me/durmitor-national-park/","https://musafirintransit.com/durmitor-national-park-montenegro/","https://thesandyfeet.com/durmitor-national-park-montenegro/","https://www.curiousgoosetravel.com/post/things-to-do-durmitor-montenegro"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Zipline at the Tara bridge","type":"activity","detail":"Cables run out over the gorge beside the tall arched bridge, the fastest way to feel how far down the river sits.","season":[5,6,7,8,9],"link":"https://viaferratapiva.me/blog/djurdjevica-tara-bridge/","evidence":{"n_sources":5,"of":26,"urls":["https://viaferratapiva.me/blog/djurdjevica-tara-bridge/","https://www.montenegro-spirit.com/destinations/durmitor-national-park/","https://360monte.me/durmitor-national-park/","https://adriaticways.com/durmitor-national-park/","https://www.expedia.com.my/things-to-do/kotor-to-durmitor-black-lake-djurdjevica-tara-bridge-tour.a46012231.activity-details"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Ski at Savin Kuk","type":"activity","detail":"The main run drops around three and a half kilometres from the chairlift, snow usually holding on this plateau for months.","season":[12,1,2,3],"evidence":{"n_sources":5,"of":26,"urls":["https://www.skiresort.info/ski-resort/savin-kuk-zabljak/","https://www.zabljak.com/savin-kuk-zabljak-ski-centar","https://www.durmitornp.com/zabljak/","https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/%C5%BDabljak","https://montenegro.com/en/blog/zabljak-durmitor-guide